  "content": "<h1>FTB JEI 擴充套件</h1>\n<p>JEI 擴充套件是一個小型模組，旨在為其他模組與 JEI 之間搭建橋樑，當這些模組要麼沒有提供 JEI 插件，要麼只提供基本功能時。</p>\n\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<p>以下功能基於 <code>1.21.1</code> 版本，隨著模組更新、新增或移除對 JEI 的支援，這些功能可能會有所變動。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ex-pattern-provider\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>ExtendedAE</code></a> - 為 ExtendedAE 添加 JEI 支援，目前 ExtendedAE 僅支援 <code>EMI</code> 和 <code>REI</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancedae\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>AdvancedAE</code></a> - 為 AdvancedAE 添加 JEI 支援，目前 AdvancedAE 僅支援 <code>EMI</code> 和 <code>REI</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>即使未安裝這些支援的模組，本模組仍可正常運作，因為每個插件都是依條件註冊的</p>\n\n<h2>問題回報</h2>\n<p>請將任何問題回報至我們的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題追蹤系統</a></p>\n\n<h2>功能請求</h2>\n<p>如果您希望本模組支援其他模組，請在我們的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題追蹤系統</a> 建立議題，我們會進行評估。</p>\n\n<h2>支援管道</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>模組包</strong>相關問題請至: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-modpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-modpack</a></li>\n<li><strong>模組</strong>相關問題請至: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-mod-issues</a></li>\n<li>單純有疑問？歡迎加入我們的 Discord: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/discord</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr>\n\n<h2>掌握最新動態</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-discord.webp\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fgithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-github.webp\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitter-x.webp\" alt=\"Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fyoutube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-youtube.webp\" alt=\"YouTube\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitch.webp\" alt=\"Twitch\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252finstagram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-instagram.webp\" alt=\"Instagram\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ffacebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-facebook.webp\" alt=\"Facebook\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftiktok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-tiktok.webp\" alt=\"TikTok\"></a></p>",
